  "description": "The farmers' greenhouse ship: a long red hull with dark ribs, two glass barrel-vault greenhouses full of grow beds on its roof, a cream bus-fronted cab on the bow with a railed walk on its roof, cream and red water tanks on its flanks and a nacelle each side of the taller aft block. Inside, the entry room behind the cab, a grow hall of rack towers, the engine room aft, and a ladder up into each greenhouse. Sixteen lift jets under the belly hold it up and the two nacelle drives push it along.",
